OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA fresh start this morning with
OL,6,Fsome early brightness, especially in
OL,7,Fthe south. Cloud and outbreaks of rain
OL,8,Fwill spread southwards though through
OL,9,Fthe day, before turning brighter again
OL,10,Flater from the north. Temperatures a
OL,11,Flittle below average for August.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FLargely dry this evening and
OL,14,Fovernight, but a few showers may move
OL,15,Falong the east coast at times.
OL,16,FClearing skies will lead to a chilly
OL,17,Fnight, especially in the countryside.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
